<mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading guide&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Solid: request or data path. Dashed: identity, event or pull path.&lt;br&gt;Each tier talks only to the next one: the client never reaches the pods, the pods are reached only from the ALB subnets, and the database only from the pods through the proxy.&lt;br&gt;Platform tier: GitHub Actions and CodeBuild deploy the stacks and the Helm release, the bastion reads the cluster, alarms and SNS report problems." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="870" width="1100" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>